XNormalTransistorPmos6 FirstStageYsourceTransconductance outFirstStage in2 FirstStageYsourceTransconductance sourceNmos s3c_pfet_01v8_lvt_w14p21_l0p89_m1__nf4_gboth_sdfull_outs
XNormalTransistorPmos7 FirstStageYsourceTransconductance FirstStageYout1 in1 FirstStageYsourceTransconductance sourceNmos s3c_pfet_01v8_lvt_w14p21_l0p89_m1__nf4_gboth_sdfull_outs
